      {
        "id": "CUE-002",
        "start": 9.2,
        "end": 17.4,
        "text": "第一，如果你以一个赚钱的目的去做自媒体，请在前期泯灭你想做什么",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-002.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
