      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-003",
        "start": 17.72,
        "end": 22.08,
        "text": "去想用户需要什么，但不是泯灭个人特色",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-004",
        "start": 22.4,
        "end": 24.86,
        "text": "而是用自己去对其用户",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-005",
        "start": 25.57,
        "end": 31.18,
        "text": "但不要抛弃真诚，你没那个脑子欺骗越来越聪明的用户",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-005.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-006",
        "start": 32.009,
        "end": 40.33,
        "text": "第二。你的视频其实是一个产品，考虑用户需求以外，也要考虑平台喜好和大方向",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-006.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-007",
        "start": 40.34,
        "end": 48.68,
        "text": "就像创业要考虑大环境和风口，不要四九年入国军，也不要在二六年还偏",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-007.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-008",
        "start": 51.38,
        "end": 53.96,
        "text": "第三，作为一个普通人",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-008.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-009",
        "start": 54.41,
        "end": 57.27,
        "text": "不要给你数据不好的视频投流",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-009.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-010",
        "start": 57.58,
        "end": 61.28,
        "text": "你根本不会投。会扰乱你的账号的",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-010.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-011",
        "start": 61.68,
        "end": 66.43,
        "text": "并且给你屎一样的作品投流，堪比往河里撒钱",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-011.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-012",
        "start": 66.86,
        "end": 70.6,
        "text": "投流是锦上添花，不是雪中送炭",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-012.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-013",
        "start": 71.49,
        "end": 75.23,
        "text": "第四。如果你是一个生企的老板",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-013.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-014",
        "start": 75.65,
        "end": 81.65,
