        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-014.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-015",
        "start": 82.31,
        "end": 84.16,
        "text": "不要听别人的了",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-015.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-016",
        "start": 85.02,
        "end": 92.8,
        "text": "你的目的呢，其实是转化，Ip的目的呢是提高品牌影响力，在反哺到转化",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-016.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-017",
        "start": 93.1,
        "end": 96.5,
        "text": "你没有资格现在去曲线救国",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-017.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-018",
        "start": 97.6,
        "end": 102.48,
