        "end": 115.63,
        "text": "你的作品不火是因为你的作品是一坨屎，和你的号没多大关系",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-020.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-021",
        "start": 116.48,
        "end": 119.53,
        "text": "第六哎哎亲爱的博主",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-021.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-022",
        "start": 120.21,
        "end": 126.32,
        "text": "自媒体是一份工作，并且很轻松，高薪非常高薪",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-022.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
