      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-023",
        "start": 126.33,
        "end": 131.98,
        "text": "所以请全力以赴用你全部的生活去滋养你的创作",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-023.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-024",
        "start": 132.59,
        "end": 136.24,
        "text": "不要妄想无比轻松地赚到那么多钱",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-024.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-025",
        "start": 137.05,
        "end": 143.66,
        "text": "请尊重用户，也珍重品牌方，认真去选题，认真去拍摄和剪辑",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-025.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-026",
        "start": 144.14,
        "end": 148.99,
        "text": "你已经一条广告十几万了，能不能不要对自己那么好",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-026.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-027",
        "start": 149.63,
        "end": 156.8,
        "text": "第七，如果你是个普通人，请不要妄想用简单的方式获取流量",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-027.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-028",
        "start": 157.13,
        "end": 163.25,
        "text": "请认真全力以赴去整活，适当的出卖一些颜面和灵魂",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-028.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-029",
        "start": 163.26,
        "end": 169.72,
        "text": "凭什么你一个月薪几千的人可以不费吹灰之力让你的工资翻几倍呢？",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-029.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-030",
        "start": 169.73,
        "end": 175.05,
        "text": "对吧，喜好是一夜之间，不是日积月累",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-030.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-031",
        "start": 175.51,
        "end": 181.7,
        "text": "一条视频数据不好，请不要坚持，换方向吧，那就是一坨屎",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-031.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-032",
        "start": 182.02,
        "end": 185.66,
        "text": "坚持拉屎呢，只会把你的马桶拉堵",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-032.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-033",
        "start": 186.13,
        "end": 192.24,
        "text": "第九。请放弃享受刷短视频，去享受品鉴刷短视频",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-033.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
